OL,3,GNEWSA'Doughnut' crackdown extended in
OL,4,Atown's car parks
OL,5,
OL,6,FA public space protection order (PSPO)
OL,7,Fhas been extended in a Lincolnshire
OL,8,Ftown following reports of drivers doing
OL,9,F"doughnuts" around car parks.
OL,11,FSouth Kesteven District Council
OL,12,Fimplemented a three-year extension to
OL,13,Fthree car parks in Stamford at a
OL,14,Fcouncil meeting on Tuesday.
OL,16,FPSPOs give councils and the police
OL,17,Fadditional powers to deal with a
OL,18,Fparticular problem in a certain area.
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,387,380,200,160,0,100
