OL,3,GNEWSA'Doughnut' crackdown extended in
OL,4,Atown's car parks
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe council said the PSPO would help
OL,7,Ftackle persistent anti-social behaviour
OL,8,Fby issuing fines to offenders of up to
OL,9,F#10 or up to #1,000 if it goes to
OL,10,Fcourt.
